** | Free tier |\n| Thumbnail | Canva or GPT Image | Free-$13/month |\n\n**Total cost: ~$15-35/month** to produce professional whiteboard explainers.\n\n---\n\n## The Honest Assessment: Does This Format Work for Your Goals?\n\nGoing back to what I told you in the previous analysis — whiteboard animation fits a specific category of topics well. And this video proves it: it's a **book summary** channel, not a geopolitics channel.\n\n**This format + your constraints (6 videos/month, 15-20 min, faceless) = a strong match for:**\n- Book summaries (like this video)\n- Business case studies\n- Self-improvement / psychology explainers\n- Economics / finance concepts\n- \"How things work\" educational content\n\n**It does NOT match geopolitics/military/political scandals** (needs maps, archival photos, cinematic graphics — not stickmen).\n\nIf you want to do topics like this video — book summaries, habit science, productivity, business stories — in Hindi with whiteboard animation, that's a proven format. This specific video has been accumulating views since June 2019 and is still getting ~30-40 VPH after 7 years. That's the definition of evergreen content.\n\nDo you want me to identify the specific channel this video belongs to and analyze their full content strategy and earnings?","truncated_fields":["content"]}
