ell -Command \"npx skills list -g\"` to see all installed skills.\n199: \n200: ---\n201: \n202: **Original skill by Vercel Labs: https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills**\n203: **Windows fix by: https://github.com/KimYx0207/findskill**\n204: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
