ories**\n\nI'm now organizing the tool list into four categories: Geopolitics, Commercial Whiteboard, Automated Whiteboard (CLI), and Universal Faceless tools. I've placed After Effects and GeoLayers 3 in the Geopolitics stack, while VideoScribe, Doodly, and Explaindio belong to the Commercial Whiteboard category. Remotion and `@remotion/paths` fit into the Automated stack.\n\n\n**Refining Workflow Choices**\n\nI'm now refining the tool list with your channel constraints in mind, Priyanshu. I've re-reviewed the GitHub tools like `whiteboard-video-engine`, `whiteboard-animator`, and `handanim`, and re-evaluated `Inkplainer-OS` as a VideoScribe alternative. I've also re-confirmed ElevenLabs and Suno, along with Envato Elements and Freepik. The core insight is: *Nitish can't make Nitish videos with these tools*. I now need to explicitly guide you through the decision.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
